Adaptation of examples/marker.tsx
Kind: mechanical
Reason: the element given through `render` becomes a function so jsx-a11y sees the link's content; the rendered DOM is the same
--- a/examples/marker.tsx
+++ b/examples/marker.tsx
@@ -50,7 +50,13 @@
       </Section>
 
